>David Damerell wrote:
>> Quoting  Jack Bolsen  <jbolsen@verizon.net>:

>> >I disagree with this statement unless you are playing a gnome and you
>> >want to try the protection racket. Leveling up makes good sense because
>> >it will increase the likelihood of casting spells successfully and
